@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms - TheBluesland</PageTitle>
<PageMetadata
    Title="Terms - TheBluesland"
    Description="About TheBluesland's editorial content, Spotify links and attribution. TheBluesland is an independent personal project."
    CanonicalPath="/terms"
    ImagePath="/og-image.png" />

<article class="terms">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <h2>About the site</h2>
    <p>
        TheBluesland is a personal, non-commercial project for sharing playlists and writing
        about music. The notes describe the selections and offer listening suggestions.
        Playlists can change over time, so descriptions and displayed details may not always
        reflect the latest version on Spotify.
    </p>
    <h2>Listening and availability</h2>
    <p>
        Music is played on Spotify, under Spotify's terms and availability rules.
        TheBluesland does not host music or provide audio downloads.
    </p>
    <h2>Attribution</h2>
    <p>
        Playlist details and cover images are provided through Spotify. Music, artwork and
        trademarks remain the property of their respective rights holders.
    </p>
    <p>
        "Spotify" and the Spotify logo are trademarks of Spotify AB. TheBluesland is not affiliated
        with or endorsed by Spotify.
    </p>
</article>
